# Copy to .env (gitignored) for `pnpm --filter app dev`. Values are inlined into the web bundle by
# Expo, so they are public: never put a secret here.
#
# Turnstile sitekey (VB-72). Unset = Cloudflare's always-passes test key, which is what local
# development and CI want (the local API skips the check with the test secret). The deploy scripts
# set the real key of the widget (docs/environments.md).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=1x00000000000000000000AA
